  "description": "DSL.Reqnroll is Reqnroll plugin that enables use of dynamic test data in Reqnroll steps by bringing in variables, regular expressions and bespoke transformations. It's a re-write of SpecFlow.DSL library, written originally by Wenyuan(Ryan) Song and Liam Flanagan, to align it with Reqnroll.\n\n\t\tCapabilities:\n\t\t-> Create dynamic test data and refer it in another step\n\t\t-> Create dynamic test data using regular expression\n\t\t-> Simple calculations via bespoke transformations",
